{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，<strong>荷蘭光刻機巨頭ASML行政總裁克裏斯託夫·富凱近日接受《Future Proof》播客採訪時表示，由於缺少EUV光刻機，中國先進半導體技術仍落後國際先進水平約10至15年。這也是他此次採訪中最受關注的判斷之一。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588254.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:44:29.468986+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:30:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_hash":"1bda5981378619199c03bddade203ff454aebf18cd88e738754c267aa2b1e343","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}